  "body": "* Set on a 188sqm section with 102sqm indoor living space\r\n* 3 spacious bedrooms\r\n* 2 luxury bathrooms with premium finishes\r\n* Stylish LED mirrors with sensor lighting\r\n* Soaring ceilings creating a light-filled, spacious atmosphere\r\n* Open-plan living and dining designed for modern lifestyles\r\n* Quality construction with exceptional attention to detail\r\n*  Contemporary design combining elegance and functionality\r\n* Seamless indoor living spaces perfect for entertaining\r\n* Low-maintenance, modern living\r\n\r\nStep into a home that effortlessly combines quality craftsmanship with contemporary elegance. Sitting on a 188sqm land area and offering a generous 102sqm of well-designed indoor space, this stunning residence features 3 generous bedrooms and 2 beautifully appointed bathrooms, perfectly tailored for modern living.\r\n\r\nThe impressive soaring ceilings create an immediate sense of space and light, while the practical open-plan layout delivers seamless flow across living, dining and entertaining zones. Every detail has been meticulously refined, crafting a residence that balances luxurious texture with a warm, welcoming ambience.\r\n\r\nThe designer bathrooms are fitted with premium finishes and stylish sensor LED mirrors, adding sophisticated aesthetics and daily practicality. Constructed with high-quality materials and thoughtful design throughout, this home delivers long-lasting comfort, full functionality and timeless modern appeal.\r\n\r\nIdeal for families pursuing a refined lifestyle or buyers seeking hassle-free low-maintenance living, this exceptional property is guaranteed to impress.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson and Amy 022 571 7074 today to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home to experience it for yourself. For more information, and find all you need please visit https://www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
